      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.87,
      "end_seconds": 142.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.14,
      "end_seconds": 144.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "I've got gout"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.76,
      "end_seconds": 156.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "Are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.56,
      "end_seconds": 160.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.72,
      "end_seconds": 163.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.18,
      "end_seconds": 169.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.88,
      "end_seconds": 188.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.91,
      "end_seconds": 197.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "bear with me while this finishes.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.37,
      "end_seconds": 229.13,
      "duration_seconds": 14.76,
      "text": "Okay: BMI works out to to 25.7, saturation 98 percent, pulse 78. And height 154 centimetres, pressure 121 over 71, temperature is 36.9 degrees, weight 61 kilos."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.49,
      "end_seconds": 233.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.8,
      "end_seconds": 236.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.37,
      "end_seconds": 248.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Your blood pressure and heart rate are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.38,
      "end_seconds": 271.19,
      "duration_seconds": 17.81,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. From what you've told me and what I found, this is probably prediabetes. Let me just check I've got this right. You've had no symptoms, since Friday, severe, and no frequent urination or blurred vision."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.98,
      "end_seconds": 273.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "mm, that's right"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.65,
      "end_seconds": 318.39,
      "duration_seconds": 27.74,
      "text": "We should do a repeat HbA1c for prediabetes. Walk thirty minutes daily, cut sugary drinks and aim to lose five percent of your weight. The thing that would worry me is if the symptoms get worse. If that happens, go to emergency. I'll want another look in six months. Tell me what you've taken from all that, so I can fill in any gaps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 319.09,
      "end_seconds": 323.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "so, I come back in six months is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.57,
      "end_seconds": 332.02,
      "duration_seconds": 6.45,
      "text": "So, yes, exactly right. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 333.23,
      "end_seconds": 334.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    }
  ]
